# Revs listed here are skipped by `git blame`, so a mechanical reformat does not
# become the author of every line it re-indented.
#
# Enable locally once per clone:
#   git config blame.ignoreRevsFile .git-blame-ignore-revs
#
# Append the SHA of every formatting-only commit below, one per line, in the order
# they land. A commit belongs here only when it changes no token other than
# whitespace and line breaks; a commit that also renames an identifier or moves a
# branch must stay visible to blame.
